WEBVTT

01:40.760 --> 01:44.400
Yingying, luckily, we had you around.
Thank you.

01:45.400 --> 01:48.520
When our family was in trouble,
you gave us a hand too.

01:48.600 --> 01:50.080
We are family.
You do not have to thank me.

01:51.080 --> 01:53.360
All right. I will keep my gratitude, then.

01:53.440 --> 01:55.520
Once I reach home and settle down,

01:55.600 --> 01:57.200
I will try my best
to find you a good husband

01:57.280 --> 01:58.840
to make your wish come true!

01:59.360 --> 02:00.760
Just focus on yourself.
I am not in a rush!

02:02.080 --> 02:02.920
Yingying,

02:03.560 --> 02:06.680
be good at home while we are gone.

02:06.760 --> 02:08.639
Do not simply go out, all right?

02:08.720 --> 02:13.440
My dear sister,
you do not have to come with me.

02:13.520 --> 02:14.520
You are needed at home.

02:14.600 --> 02:16.400
You are just worried
that I will nag at Li Feng, are you not?

02:16.920 --> 02:19.640
Is he scared of being reprimanded
after doing this?

02:19.720 --> 02:21.480
When I get there,
I will give him a proper scolding!

02:23.080 --> 02:25.320
All right! We have spoken enough.
Let us get going.

02:26.160 --> 02:27.240
Take care of yourselves on the way!

02:27.320 --> 02:28.240
Let us depart.

02:28.320 --> 02:33.120
HARBOR

02:34.360 --> 02:38.720
I suppose Mr. Zhao
still knows Ms. Ji the best.

02:40.400 --> 02:45.040
Mr. Bai, you should just focus
on doing your own tasks properly.

03:02.000 --> 03:04.960
Madam, you have drunk too much.

03:09.160 --> 03:13.000
I am confined here all day.
I cannot do anything.

03:14.480 --> 03:16.240
I might as well entertain myself.

03:20.920 --> 03:23.360
Mr. Zhao has been going out frequently
in recent days.

03:23.440 --> 03:25.080
However, he has been very secretive.

03:26.280 --> 03:28.280
I am not able to find out
what he is doing.

03:31.240 --> 03:33.040
What else could he be doing?

03:33.600 --> 03:36.000
It must be related to Ji Yingying.

03:37.160 --> 03:39.840
Ji Yingying's aunt came and left.

03:40.360 --> 03:42.480
She even accepted a large order from Tubo.

03:43.600 --> 03:44.920
She is rushing work for it.

03:45.880 --> 03:48.520
Once Zhao Xiuyuan
makes up his mind on something,

03:49.040 --> 03:50.720
he will not just sit by and wait.

03:52.200 --> 03:55.440
He must have had a hand in it.

03:59.200 --> 04:01.120
You once said

04:01.640 --> 04:06.160
it would benefit us
regardless of whether she succeeds or not.

04:10.240 --> 04:11.480
If she succeeds,

04:12.360 --> 04:13.800
I will have her life.

04:15.160 --> 04:16.480
If she fails,

04:17.440 --> 04:18.880
I will also have her life.

04:23.200 --> 04:26.200
Do you not think she and I are alike?

04:28.000 --> 04:29.560
We do not believe in fate.

04:30.800 --> 04:34.280
We both want to survive
through our own efforts.

04:38.560 --> 04:40.920
But she has so many people who love her.

04:43.000 --> 04:44.400
Her parents,

04:45.320 --> 04:46.760
her friends,

04:47.960 --> 04:49.880
and the man she loves.

04:50.960 --> 04:52.040
Why?

04:54.000 --> 04:55.880
Why is she the same as me,

04:55.960 --> 05:00.000
yet she is not falling
into the abyss with me?

05:04.240 --> 05:05.440
Why?

05:12.560 --> 05:14.760
The lonely white rabbit,
gentle and bright.

05:17.400 --> 05:18.520
Hops to the east,

05:19.800 --> 05:20.920
yearns for west's light.

05:23.360 --> 05:25.160
New clothes may gleam
with a shine so true,

05:26.520 --> 05:28.200
but old friends are the ones
who will see you through.

05:28.720 --> 05:29.560
Madam!

05:32.000 --> 05:35.640
If there is an opportunity,
I will do everything I can.

05:38.240 --> 05:39.160
Yu Yuan,

05:41.040 --> 05:42.360
you are all I have.

05:45.760 --> 05:47.600
No matter what happens,

05:51.280 --> 05:53.720
you must put your safety first.

05:55.640 --> 05:56.480
Do you understand?

06:00.280 --> 06:01.600
Yes, I do.

06:24.080 --> 06:25.920
The 1,000 guan is paid off now.

06:27.240 --> 06:30.160
However, there is still
no news about Yan's dowry.

06:35.080 --> 06:38.240
Hey, why don't… you lend us a little more?

06:39.560 --> 06:40.720
Li Feng,

06:40.800 --> 06:42.840
you have got us all into trouble
with your gambling.

06:43.360 --> 06:44.960
Why are you not showing any remorse?

06:45.040 --> 06:46.440
How can you be so shameless
as to ask from my sister?

06:46.520 --> 06:48.160
Shut up! Was I talking to you?

06:48.240 --> 06:51.240
I was tricked by others!
I did not lose on purpose!

06:52.400 --> 06:56.240
Besides,
your sister's business has improved.

06:56.320 --> 06:57.920
So what is wrong
with lending me some money?

06:58.000 --> 06:58.840
Am I right?

06:58.920 --> 07:00.840
Here. Let me get you a cup of tea.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.000
Have a drink.

07:06.560 --> 07:07.560
Li Feng, listen here!

07:07.640 --> 07:09.640
You are wrong to get into gambling!

07:10.680 --> 07:13.040
What did you promise when you asked
for my sister's hand in marriage?

07:13.640 --> 07:16.240
You would get a successful job
after marriage. Where is it now?

07:16.840 --> 07:18.680
Are you not ashamed
to call yourself a man?

07:18.760 --> 07:19.920
Hey!

07:20.680 --> 07:23.360
When your family was in trouble,
I know that she secretly helped you!

07:23.440 --> 07:24.800
What now?

07:24.880 --> 07:27.680
Are you criticizing me
just because you did me a small favor?

07:28.440 --> 07:30.200
All right! I understand!

07:30.280 --> 07:31.600
You do not want to help us.

07:31.680 --> 07:33.200
You want to cut ties with me! Am I right?

07:34.520 --> 07:36.960
We are family.
You can just get straight to the point.

07:37.040 --> 07:38.120
Li Feng!

07:38.200 --> 07:40.640
Do you think my sister has it easy
with her business?

07:41.640 --> 07:43.840
You lost 1,000 guan!

07:43.920 --> 07:46.040
Yingying is a little girl.

07:46.120 --> 07:49.400
She had to run everywhere
to finally gather enough money for you!

07:49.480 --> 07:51.560
They never asked you
to go into a bond of debt, did they?

07:52.160 --> 07:55.480
How can you be so shameless
as to take advantage of their family?

07:55.560 --> 07:56.960
Bond of debt?

07:57.040 --> 07:58.680
How dare you bring that up?

07:59.840 --> 08:00.800
I see it now.

08:01.320 --> 08:03.280
You two are working together to set me up,
are you not?

08:03.360 --> 08:04.240
- You…!
- What about me?

08:04.320 --> 08:05.320
- You are twisting facts!
- Was I wrong?

08:05.400 --> 08:07.600
Say that again!
I will teach you a lesson today!

08:07.680 --> 08:09.360
- You want to teach me a lesson?
- Get out!

08:12.600 --> 08:13.520
I will leave now.

08:14.880 --> 08:16.000
Are you all right?

08:16.880 --> 08:19.080
Here. Sit down.

08:22.800 --> 08:23.920
Slowly.

08:26.040 --> 08:27.440
Boatman, when will we reach the shore?

08:27.520 --> 08:28.760
Soon!

08:28.840 --> 08:31.200
Why are you not getting some rest
inside the boat's cabin?

08:33.320 --> 08:34.679
The two women are too noisy.

08:34.760 --> 08:36.039
I came to get some air.

08:51.280 --> 08:52.480
Ms. Ji!

08:54.120 --> 08:55.320
- Mr. Ji!
- What's wrong, Gui?

08:55.400 --> 08:57.440
Mrs. Ji… Mrs. Ji is in trouble!

09:00.520 --> 09:03.040
There is so much blood!
I have never been more unlucky!

09:03.120 --> 09:04.880
I cannot used my boat now!

09:05.600 --> 09:07.640
You two are sisters!

09:07.720 --> 09:09.120
You got into a fight!

09:09.200 --> 09:10.560
There was not a need to kill her,
was there?

09:10.640 --> 09:12.080
- Mother!
- Move!

09:12.160 --> 09:13.600
HARBOR

09:14.680 --> 09:16.000
- Mother?
- Mother!

09:16.520 --> 09:17.640
- Mother!
- Mrs. Ji…

09:18.160 --> 09:19.960
Mother, what happened?

09:21.720 --> 09:22.840
It was not me.

09:23.480 --> 09:24.880
It really was not me.

09:25.600 --> 09:27.800
Your aunt… is dead.

09:28.320 --> 09:29.320
I did not kill her!

09:29.400 --> 09:31.200
I did not kill your aunt!

09:31.280 --> 09:32.360
Mother…

09:38.960 --> 09:40.280
Aunt Yan…

09:43.880 --> 09:45.080
That…!

09:49.120 --> 09:51.200
Uncle Feng, what exactly happened?

09:51.800 --> 09:54.040
It was all your mother!
She killed my wife!

09:54.120 --> 09:55.800
- Impossible!
- You are lying!

09:55.880 --> 09:59.160
Mrs. Ji of Sandaoyan
murdered Mrs. Li of Ba County.

09:59.880 --> 10:01.400
We have witness and evidence here.

10:01.480 --> 10:02.840
Lock her up in the county magistrate's
prison for prosecution later on.

10:02.920 --> 10:04.960
Everyone else, move aside!

10:05.040 --> 10:06.200
Hold on!

10:06.280 --> 10:08.000
Wait!

10:08.080 --> 10:09.440
Why would my mother kill my aunt?

10:09.520 --> 10:10.800
There must be a mistake somewhere!

10:10.880 --> 10:13.200
If you hinder us from performing our duty,
we will bring you in together!

10:13.280 --> 10:14.440
- Move!
- Let us go!

10:14.520 --> 10:15.480
- Mother, do not be afraid!
- Yingying!

10:15.560 --> 10:16.480
- Mother, do not worry!
- Mother!

10:16.560 --> 10:17.560
Ting!

10:17.640 --> 10:19.000
- Mother!
- I did not kill your aunt!

10:19.080 --> 10:20.880
I really did not kill her!

10:20.960 --> 10:22.200
- Leave your explanation
- Mother, I know!

10:22.280 --> 10:23.480
for the magistrate!

10:23.560 --> 10:26.720
TANGCHANG COUNTY MAGISTRATE

10:26.800 --> 10:28.600
Officer, it has been a long time now.

10:28.680 --> 10:29.800
Is the county magistrate still occupied?

10:29.880 --> 10:31.840
Would you please help us
talk to him again?

10:31.920 --> 10:33.120
Even if we are not able to see him,

10:33.200 --> 10:34.840
it would be enough
if you could explain the situation!

10:34.920 --> 10:35.880
I agree!

10:35.960 --> 10:37.480
We already said he is preoccupied!

10:37.560 --> 10:38.720
Get going!

10:47.560 --> 10:48.480
Apologies for my intrusion.

10:48.560 --> 10:50.400
I did not mean to disturb you
from your work.

10:50.480 --> 10:52.040
There is no such thing!

10:52.120 --> 10:56.280
It is my honor to have the opportunity
to sit down and have a drink with you.

10:56.880 --> 10:58.120
The people outside…?

10:58.760 --> 11:00.800
I am not going to see them! No!

11:01.400 --> 11:03.040
Mr. Zhao is correct.

11:03.120 --> 11:05.960
We have all the evidence.
There is no room for denial.

11:07.600 --> 11:08.560
Here's to you.

11:15.360 --> 11:18.120
TANGCHANG COUNTY MAGISTRATE

11:20.320 --> 11:22.560
We cannot just keep waiting here.

11:23.440 --> 11:26.040
Since the boatman and Uncle Feng
were at the scene,

11:26.120 --> 11:27.720
I will go and ask them
about what happened again.

11:27.800 --> 11:30.160
Yaoting, find a legal practitioner.

11:30.240 --> 11:32.120
Have him take a look at this case
and see what we should do next.

11:32.920 --> 11:34.440
- All right.
- Ms. Ji!

11:34.520 --> 11:36.400
- Mr. Ji!
- Gui!

11:36.480 --> 11:38.600
I have bad news!
A thief broke into our residence!

11:38.680 --> 11:40.400
All the silk we just stocked up
have been stolen!

11:40.480 --> 11:41.480
What?

11:42.560 --> 11:44.240
Yaoting, I will head home to have a look.

11:44.320 --> 11:45.520
You should still look
for a legal practitioner.

11:45.600 --> 11:47.080
- Let us split up.
- All right.

11:47.160 --> 11:48.200
Come on, Gui!

11:51.240 --> 11:53.880
Was it only the silk?
Did they steal any of our money?

11:53.960 --> 11:55.000
Only the silk!

11:55.080 --> 11:56.800
I noticed that the door was broken open
when I came home.

11:56.880 --> 11:57.800
Even the storehouse has been emptied!

11:57.880 --> 11:59.880
I cannot think of which scoundrel
who would do this!

12:00.880 --> 12:03.720
Gui, take some money from the house
and go to my brother.

12:03.800 --> 12:04.720
I will take a look at the storehouse

12:04.800 --> 12:06.400
and see if the thief
left any traces behind.

12:06.480 --> 12:07.320
Okay.

12:28.960 --> 12:30.600
They did not steal money.

12:30.680 --> 12:32.800
That means wealth is not what they seek.

12:33.520 --> 12:36.160
They were able to move a large amount
of silk in a short period of time.

12:36.240 --> 12:37.640
That means they came prepared.

12:38.160 --> 12:41.240
They struck at the same time
Mother got into trouble.

12:51.880 --> 12:53.240
Thief! Stop!

12:56.120 --> 12:57.680
Help!

12:58.280 --> 12:59.600
Help me!

13:09.560 --> 13:11.120
Mrs. Ji is imprisoned.

13:11.200 --> 13:12.720
Their business got hit.

13:13.520 --> 13:18.160
Do you think Ji Yingying will submit
in the face of this double crisis?

13:18.760 --> 13:20.760
Instead of becoming
Zhao Xiuyuan's concubine,

13:21.280 --> 13:22.840
she might as well work for me.

13:23.920 --> 13:26.840
Master, Ms. Ji's residence caught fire.

13:34.840 --> 13:37.240
- Let me go! I want to save Yingying!
- The fire is too strong!

13:37.320 --> 13:39.600
- Are you trying to die?
- She is alone!

13:39.680 --> 13:41.960
- She is inside all alone!
- No! Listen to me!

13:42.640 --> 13:43.800
No!

13:43.880 --> 13:45.640
The fire is too strong!
Stop rushing to get in!

13:45.720 --> 13:46.880
Behave!

14:24.760 --> 14:26.120
Pin, the fire is too strong!

14:26.200 --> 14:27.160
- Yingying!
- Are you trying to kill yourself?

14:27.240 --> 14:28.600
Yingying is here!

14:28.680 --> 14:29.520
Yingying!

14:30.880 --> 14:32.120
Yingying, are you all right?

14:32.800 --> 14:33.640
Are you all right?

14:33.720 --> 14:34.720
- Yingying!
- Put out the fire!

14:35.480 --> 14:38.240
- Yingying! Wake up!
- Put out the fire quickly!

14:39.240 --> 14:41.400
What happened? What is going on?

14:41.920 --> 14:43.120
What happened here?

14:45.120 --> 14:46.440
- Yingying!
- Yingying!

14:47.960 --> 14:49.160
Put out the fire!

14:49.240 --> 14:50.440
Hurry up and put out the fire!

14:50.520 --> 14:52.240
- Yingying!
- Ji Yingying!

14:52.320 --> 14:53.240
What happened?

14:53.320 --> 14:55.000
- Ms. Ji!
- Yingying! She is waking up!

14:55.080 --> 14:55.920
- She is alive!
- Put out the fire first!

14:56.000 --> 14:57.320
- Put out the fire first!
- Put out the fire!

14:57.400 --> 14:58.440
- The fire!
- Thank goodness you are awake!

14:58.520 --> 15:00.120
Pin, look after her!

15:01.840 --> 15:03.080
Hurry!

15:22.000 --> 15:23.840
Master, are you all right?
Are you injured?

15:23.920 --> 15:25.600
- I am fine.
- That is good to hear.

15:25.680 --> 15:27.080
FRUIT SHOP, CANDIED FRUITS

15:27.160 --> 15:28.760
Please forgive me for being frank.

15:29.720 --> 15:32.440
However useful Ms. Ji is,

15:32.960 --> 15:35.120
she cannot compare
to a millionth of your life.

15:35.720 --> 15:39.400
You should not have put
so much importance in her.

15:41.080 --> 15:42.320
What are we going to do

15:43.240 --> 15:45.280
if something were to happen

15:46.160 --> 15:47.640
to you tonight?

15:59.680 --> 16:00.720
Ji Yingying

16:02.880 --> 16:05.360
has her own views toward brocade.

16:06.280 --> 16:07.880
She is highly talented.

16:09.240 --> 16:13.600
If we want to achieve our goal,
a talent like her is a must.

16:13.680 --> 16:14.960
That was why I saved her.

16:15.880 --> 16:18.200
The fire was not as bad earlier.

16:18.280 --> 16:21.440
If I was not perfectly confident,
I would not have acted brashly.

16:23.240 --> 16:24.240
If…

16:24.920 --> 16:26.480
I want to use a person.

16:26.560 --> 16:27.920
If I want her to work for me,

16:29.600 --> 16:32.760
there is nothing more important
than the favor for saving her life.

16:34.840 --> 16:35.960
Am I right?

16:40.960 --> 16:41.880
Where is Yingying?

16:42.880 --> 16:44.440
Why don't you go
and check on her yourself?

16:44.520 --> 16:47.320
You promised me
that you would not hurt her.

16:47.400 --> 16:48.600
Why did she almost burn to death today?

16:48.680 --> 16:51.920
If I wanted to harm her,
would I save her myself?

16:53.760 --> 16:54.680
Listen here.

16:55.200 --> 16:58.440
I will not forgive you
if anything happens to her!

17:29.240 --> 17:32.400
I am afraid we will not make it in time
for the Xu and Zou families' orders.

17:33.320 --> 17:34.280
Mr. Chen,

17:34.960 --> 17:36.600
can you please help calculate

17:36.680 --> 17:39.480
the penalty that will be incurred
by these two orders?

17:39.560 --> 17:42.640
Bloom Society will receive
a sum of payment tomorrow.

17:43.160 --> 17:46.720
Adding it to the previous orders,
there should be about 300 guan.

17:47.760 --> 17:49.080
While it is not enough,

17:49.160 --> 17:51.720
I am confident I can convince them
to delay the deadline.

17:51.800 --> 17:52.840
Following that,

17:52.920 --> 17:55.560
the Yang and Shen families' orders
are the most urgent.

17:56.680 --> 17:59.040
Other than dyeing,
we will also have to mix the color.

17:59.120 --> 18:00.360
There can be no mistakes.

18:02.200 --> 18:05.000
Can all of you handle this?

18:05.080 --> 18:06.280
Leave it to me.

18:06.840 --> 18:08.040
Do not worry.

18:08.120 --> 18:09.680
Ms. Ji has taught us for so long.

18:09.760 --> 18:11.360
We will definitely be of use this time.

18:12.200 --> 18:15.040
We must not let Yingying
fret over Bloom Society's business.

18:16.040 --> 18:17.840
We must handle it on our own.

18:18.360 --> 18:19.960
But now that we lost the silk,

18:21.960 --> 18:26.280
we will not be able to start production
on Mr. Qian's large order.

18:27.040 --> 18:29.720
It is all right. There will be a way.

18:33.240 --> 18:35.680
We have survived countless plights before.

18:35.760 --> 18:37.560
This, too, shall pass!

18:43.160 --> 18:44.640
Come on!
Let us split up and work on our tasks.

18:44.720 --> 18:45.560
Yes.

18:51.080 --> 18:52.440
It will be all right, Gui.

18:55.960 --> 18:57.000
It will be all right.

19:13.840 --> 19:15.880
- Yaoting…!
- Yingying, sit!

19:17.960 --> 19:19.000
Sit properly!

19:22.200 --> 19:23.440
Are you still feeling unwell?

19:24.160 --> 19:26.480
I am all right. How is Mother?

19:27.600 --> 19:29.320
They still refuse
to allow me to meet Mother.

19:30.080 --> 19:32.480
I gave the warden some money
and asked him to help us care for her.

19:32.560 --> 19:33.960
I have also found a legal practitioner.

19:34.640 --> 19:37.920
But the magistrate claims that
the case is still under investigation.

19:38.000 --> 19:38.920
They will pick a date for court.

19:39.800 --> 19:42.040
I will visit a few other places
to get more information.

19:42.120 --> 19:43.280
You do not have to worry about this.

19:43.360 --> 19:44.640
Do not worry.

19:49.240 --> 19:50.120
What are you doing here?

19:51.440 --> 19:52.280
Are you hurt?

19:56.320 --> 19:58.000
Mr. Zhao, save your concern.

19:58.640 --> 20:00.320
Our family is a mess right now.

20:00.400 --> 20:02.760
We are not receiving guests at the moment.
Please leave.

20:04.800 --> 20:06.400
Why was there a fire all of a sudden?

20:08.600 --> 20:09.640
Why, do you think?

20:11.320 --> 20:14.480
Who are my enemies in Yizhou?

20:15.000 --> 20:16.440
Why did they steal the silk,

20:16.520 --> 20:19.040
light a fire intentionally,
and come after my life?

20:20.160 --> 20:23.240
Someone started a fire intentionally
to go after your life?

20:29.000 --> 20:30.320
So, you suspect it was me?

20:35.440 --> 20:38.400
I would rather die
than hurt a hair on you!

20:42.640 --> 20:46.160
The people who want to harm me
have always been the same.

20:46.880 --> 20:47.920
Yingying!

20:49.600 --> 20:51.240
Yaoting, you do not need to do this,
do you?

20:53.280 --> 20:54.520
I only want to say

20:54.600 --> 20:57.720
that if I could help you
rebuild your family the last time,

20:57.800 --> 20:58.800
I can also do that again this time.

20:58.880 --> 21:01.360
We will never forget
the favor you did for us.

21:02.160 --> 21:03.800
But you are now married.

21:03.880 --> 21:05.440
There is no need to talk like this
any longer,

21:05.520 --> 21:07.360
or people will misunderstand
if they hear you.

21:07.440 --> 21:09.160
I do not care what they think!

21:11.000 --> 21:11.840
I can help you.

21:12.600 --> 21:13.760
I also want to help you!

21:13.840 --> 21:14.840
You need me now!

21:14.920 --> 21:16.120
She does not.

21:20.840 --> 21:21.920
Are you going to leave?

21:22.000 --> 21:23.680
We will not be so polite
if you still refuse to leave!

21:27.400 --> 21:29.640
All right. Since none of you believe me,

21:30.800 --> 21:32.520
I will find the true culprit.

22:05.160 --> 22:07.120
Dear, are you here to visit me?

22:20.320 --> 22:21.160
Come and have a look.

22:22.040 --> 22:23.520
What do you want to show me?

22:24.120 --> 22:25.360
Something interesting.

22:36.280 --> 22:37.200
Yu Yuan!

22:40.040 --> 22:41.320
What are you scheming?

22:41.920 --> 22:43.880
Ji Yingying almost got burned to death
in her home.

22:44.920 --> 22:46.840
Do you know about that?

22:47.520 --> 22:48.840
You have had me confined
in the house all day!

22:48.920 --> 22:50.280
Why would I know about that?

22:51.640 --> 22:53.040
I thought you knew.

23:00.320 --> 23:03.760
Must you let it out on the two of us
just because something happened to Ms. Ji?

23:04.920 --> 23:06.160
She admitted to it!

23:06.880 --> 23:08.000
She said she did it.

23:14.720 --> 23:15.920
Within Yizhou,

23:16.440 --> 23:18.680
there are countless of people
who hate Ji Yingying.

23:19.640 --> 23:23.160
But you two
are the only ones who want her dead.

23:26.600 --> 23:27.960
You envy her.

23:28.800 --> 23:30.120
The more successful she is,

23:30.200 --> 23:32.280
the more obvious it is
that you are an impostor.

23:37.720 --> 23:39.480
A lowly servant.

23:40.000 --> 23:43.080
Do you think I will care if she dies?

23:43.160 --> 23:44.800
She will not die!

23:46.000 --> 23:48.720
I learned about water torture
from your father.

23:48.800 --> 23:51.440
At the beginning,
she will only be agitated.

23:52.480 --> 23:53.600
But slowly,

23:54.600 --> 23:56.640
she will begin to lose consciousness.

23:57.400 --> 23:58.520
In the end,

23:59.480 --> 24:01.680
living is not much different
from being dead.

24:13.600 --> 24:16.240
It was me. I was jealous of Ji Yingying.

24:16.840 --> 24:18.680
I sent Yu Yuan to keep watch on you.

24:19.200 --> 24:21.280
I want to kill her
regardless of the method.

24:24.800 --> 24:27.840
This has nothing to do with Yu Yuan.

24:28.800 --> 24:30.040
Let her go, please?

24:31.640 --> 24:33.840
Do you think
I am unaware of your thoughts?

24:35.840 --> 24:38.960
You once said
we are the same type of people.

24:40.320 --> 24:42.000
We do not live for ourselves.

24:43.040 --> 24:45.600
We will only wish we were dead

24:47.560 --> 24:49.560
when the things we care for are harmed.

24:53.040 --> 24:55.080
I am the one you hate.

24:57.520 --> 24:58.360
Let her go.

25:00.240 --> 25:01.280
Let her go, please?

25:41.480 --> 25:42.600
Listen here.

25:43.920 --> 25:46.800
If anything happens to Ji Yingying,

25:47.800 --> 25:51.760
I will come after you,
regardless of whether you are behind it.

25:52.840 --> 25:54.440
I am not after anything else.

25:54.960 --> 25:56.800
I just want to make myself feel better!

26:13.560 --> 26:14.400
Yu Yuan…

26:15.080 --> 26:16.080
Yu Yuan!

26:16.760 --> 26:17.840
Yu Yuan!

26:20.200 --> 26:21.400
Yu Yuan…

26:23.840 --> 26:25.240
Yu Yuan…

26:34.720 --> 26:36.920
Within this divided land,

26:37.000 --> 26:40.280
I might be the emperor's father-in-law,
but I am but a symbol.

26:43.080 --> 26:44.840
Wait! You are the governor's secretary.

26:44.920 --> 26:46.680
Why are you afraid
of a lowly county magistrate?

26:48.160 --> 26:51.440
Above a governor's secretary
is the governor.

26:51.960 --> 26:55.000
And above the governor
is the military commissioner.

26:56.000 --> 26:59.640
While this case should be prosecuted
by the county magistrate,

27:00.200 --> 27:05.640
every minister working in Yizhou
knows about it.

27:06.880 --> 27:10.040
Ms. Ji, you should understand
what I am trying to say.

27:11.680 --> 27:15.120
You need to get to the source
of the problem to fix it.

27:24.200 --> 27:25.360
It is Niu Jin's orders.

27:26.480 --> 27:29.240
I did not say anything!

27:30.160 --> 27:31.560
Hold on! What are you talking about?

27:32.360 --> 27:34.880
How about this? Just wait here.
I will get help from Chang'an.

27:34.960 --> 27:36.400
Where are you going?

27:36.480 --> 27:39.240
Do you know who is behind all of this?
You are going for help?

27:40.000 --> 27:42.000
They are all too far away.

27:42.080 --> 27:46.200
Even Chang'an cannot oversee everything.

27:46.280 --> 27:47.520
Then…!

27:48.080 --> 27:49.360
What is going to happen to her?

27:53.960 --> 27:55.000
Shisi,

27:55.080 --> 27:57.120
help me find my uncle, Li Feng, first.

27:57.720 --> 27:59.720
I want to know
what exactly happened that day.

28:02.080 --> 28:03.400
Sure! Leave it to me.

28:10.560 --> 28:12.120
Come, have a look.

28:12.200 --> 28:14.200
HUIHUANG LANTERN SHOP

28:14.280 --> 28:16.040
Here, come have a look.

28:19.680 --> 28:20.720
Yingying,

28:20.800 --> 28:23.520
do you know who is framing Mother?

28:24.120 --> 28:26.720
Is it the Niu family?
Or is it Zhao Xiuyuan?

28:29.040 --> 28:32.040
Our master said
if you repay us within three days,

28:32.120 --> 28:33.240
nothing will happen.

28:33.320 --> 28:35.560
If you do not, you can just wait
and see what will happen

28:35.640 --> 28:37.160
to your husband and daughter!

28:37.240 --> 28:39.920
Ms. Ji, if you trust me,

28:40.000 --> 28:43.360
I can lend you a sum of money
to use as a buffer.

28:44.120 --> 28:46.920
I would rather die
than harm a hair on you!

28:52.480 --> 28:54.120
I was not careful enough.

28:55.680 --> 28:56.840
If it was not for me,

28:58.040 --> 28:59.840
Aunt Yan would not have died.

29:00.960 --> 29:03.840
- Mother also will not…
- It is not your fault that you thrive!

29:07.240 --> 29:08.560
You did nothing wrong.

29:08.640 --> 29:11.000
He also cannot
make everything go their way.

29:12.920 --> 29:16.320
There must be a place
that upholds justice within Yizhou.

29:17.200 --> 29:19.400
There must also be a minister
who dares to undertake it!

29:32.360 --> 29:38.000
BROCADE BUREAU

29:45.400 --> 29:47.320
I told you I will not let you
face everything alone.

29:48.640 --> 29:49.920
You got into trouble, did you not?

30:09.400 --> 30:10.240
Yingying?

30:12.240 --> 30:13.400
Yingying!

30:15.160 --> 30:16.200
What is it?

30:21.400 --> 30:22.360
It's nothing.

30:35.360 --> 30:39.280
YIZHOU

30:39.360 --> 30:40.360
THE BAI RESIDENCE

30:40.440 --> 30:42.960
Master, Ms. Ji is here.

30:46.320 --> 30:49.480
Thank you for saving me
from the fire last night.

30:50.440 --> 30:51.960
It was nothing.

30:52.040 --> 30:55.800
I merely did not want to lose
a good business partner like you.

30:57.320 --> 31:00.440
I was too careful with you previously.

31:01.200 --> 31:04.960
I brought a gift to express my gratitude.

31:06.360 --> 31:08.960
Whenever you want to order
silk or brocade,

31:09.040 --> 31:11.840
no matter the amount, it will be priced
a tenth lower than market price.

31:12.440 --> 31:14.240
This is a promise from Bloom Society.

31:16.280 --> 31:18.760
Whenever you are in trouble,

31:18.840 --> 31:21.320
as long as it is not immoral or illegal,

31:21.400 --> 31:23.880
I will help you out of it.

31:25.040 --> 31:27.800
This is my promise to my friend.

31:43.160 --> 31:46.600
NO REGRETS, EVEN IN DEATH.

32:09.640 --> 32:10.880
Friend?

32:12.600 --> 32:13.520
By the way,

32:14.120 --> 32:15.240
I heard that

32:15.320 --> 32:18.880
Bloom Society is purchasing
some dye materials and silk.

32:19.480 --> 32:21.760
But some people are pulling strings
behind the scene.

32:21.840 --> 32:24.560
Is that why you have not been able
to gather everything?

32:26.200 --> 32:27.080
Yes.

32:28.040 --> 32:29.720
To be frank with you,

32:29.800 --> 32:33.040
the most important thing
to you right this moment

32:33.120 --> 32:36.400
is not your business, but your mother.

32:38.240 --> 32:43.280
Will you believe
that I am able to save your mother?

32:53.920 --> 32:54.840
Yes.

32:56.320 --> 32:57.440
That is good.

32:58.200 --> 32:59.240
Let us discuss the conditions.

33:01.800 --> 33:02.760
What do you want?

33:05.680 --> 33:07.200
I want…

33:10.000 --> 33:11.280
you.

33:16.160 --> 33:20.120
I want you to dye silk and mix colors
for me from now on.

33:20.200 --> 33:24.680
I want you to get Bloom Society
and the Yu family to work for me.

33:25.200 --> 33:29.000
I want you to return to Nanzhao with me.

33:29.800 --> 33:32.680
So, that is your true intentions
toward me.

33:34.640 --> 33:36.480
You need a bigger stage.

33:37.000 --> 33:40.600
With your talents,
the stage in Yizhou is too small.

33:42.400 --> 33:45.520
You do not need to make
purchasing servants sound so pleasant.

33:47.560 --> 33:49.720
Servants? I have a lot of them.

33:49.800 --> 33:52.960
I want talented people.

33:53.880 --> 33:57.520
Of course, business negotiations
do not need to be decided on the spot.

33:57.600 --> 34:01.480
If you are not satisfied,
we can negotiate further.

34:01.560 --> 34:02.720
There is no need.

34:03.240 --> 34:06.640
To express my gratitude,
I will leave that note with you.

34:07.240 --> 34:08.520
But this…

34:08.600 --> 34:12.239
You are not a friend
one would be willing to sacrifice for.

34:12.800 --> 34:13.719
Farewell.

34:17.080 --> 34:19.880
You are being attacked on all sides,
yet you still will not concede.

34:19.960 --> 34:22.199
Are you planning
to go to that Master Zhao?

34:23.960 --> 34:27.040
All of Bloom Society know
that I came here to thank you today.

34:27.120 --> 34:29.960
If I do not return by nightfall,
people will come to look for me.

34:47.440 --> 34:50.600
A spy that was placed by your side.

34:51.880 --> 34:53.080
What are you waiting for?

34:53.159 --> 34:54.280
Ze!

34:54.360 --> 34:56.880
Please forgive me! Forgive me!

34:56.960 --> 34:58.720
I am sorry!

34:58.800 --> 35:00.880
I raised you since you were a baby!

35:00.960 --> 35:02.120
Kill her.

35:02.200 --> 35:03.800
Kill the things that you care about.

35:03.880 --> 35:06.520
From now on, you will be untouchable.

35:09.880 --> 35:10.720
Kill her!

35:19.160 --> 35:21.720
If you are troubled by feelings,

35:22.600 --> 35:25.560
you will not achieve anything in life!

35:29.560 --> 35:31.200
Father is right.

35:32.080 --> 35:35.040
Love is the most useless thing

35:36.000 --> 35:37.800
in this world.

35:47.480 --> 35:48.880
What is Bloom Society up to?

35:49.400 --> 35:51.000
Helping Ji Yingying with the orders.

35:51.080 --> 35:52.920
They have settled all the smaller orders.

35:53.000 --> 35:54.960
But they cannot sort out Mr. Qian's order.

35:55.040 --> 35:57.960
They are trying to raise funds
to purchase silk and dye materials again.

35:58.040 --> 36:00.160
Please rest assured.
Our men are watching them.

36:00.240 --> 36:03.240
Even if they get enough funds,
they will not be able to buy everything.

36:05.720 --> 36:06.800
What about Ji Yingying?

36:07.360 --> 36:10.200
Ms. Ji went to see Bai Sheng.

36:12.400 --> 36:16.280
Why do you always go
to the men you just met

36:16.800 --> 36:18.520
rather than come to me?

36:20.560 --> 36:23.360
Is Mrs. Ji doing well in prison?

36:24.720 --> 36:25.840
Since she was suddenly apprehended,

36:25.920 --> 36:27.160
it is expected
that she will be overly anxious.

36:27.680 --> 36:29.920
But because of your orders,
the warden did not use any torture on her.

36:30.000 --> 36:31.440
She is still unharmed.

36:33.160 --> 36:34.640
Overly anxious…

36:35.880 --> 36:37.600
I suppose it might affect her health.

36:46.640 --> 36:48.280
Come on!

36:48.360 --> 36:50.120
- Small!
- Place your bets!

36:50.840 --> 36:52.040
Hands off!

36:52.560 --> 36:54.120
- Big!
- Small!

36:54.200 --> 36:56.080
Small!

36:56.160 --> 36:58.400
Big!

36:59.840 --> 37:01.800
We found him! He is inside!

37:04.080 --> 37:05.480
Aunt Yan just passed away.

37:05.560 --> 37:09.120
But instead of settling her affairs,
he came here to gamble!

37:09.200 --> 37:10.480
That is not all.

37:10.560 --> 37:12.200
I saw him being very generous
inside there.

37:12.280 --> 37:13.960
He lost tens of guan in a game.

37:14.040 --> 37:15.960
He looked unperturbed.
He seemingly is not short of money!

37:16.040 --> 37:17.720
GAMBLE

37:21.560 --> 37:23.800
DA XING GAMBLING HOUSE

37:27.360 --> 37:28.200
Get him!

37:30.280 --> 37:32.600
- Come on!
- All right!

37:34.960 --> 37:36.960
You were in a lot of debts recently.

37:37.040 --> 37:38.400
Why are you so rich now?

37:38.480 --> 37:39.960
Are you hiding some shortcut

37:40.040 --> 37:41.640
- to get rich from us?
- No…!

37:41.720 --> 37:42.600
No!

37:42.680 --> 37:44.360
This money belongs to my family.

37:44.440 --> 37:46.280
My stupid wife would not let me spend it.

37:46.360 --> 37:48.480
Now that she is dead,
I can finally splurge now!

37:50.360 --> 37:51.480
That does not seem right.

37:51.560 --> 37:53.760
I heard that your wife borrowed
a lot of money from the Ji family

37:53.840 --> 37:55.320
to pay off your debts.

37:55.400 --> 37:56.600
Why would she borrow money
if she had so much?

37:56.680 --> 37:59.320
She kept this money
for our daughter's dowry.

37:59.400 --> 38:01.440
She would not have used it on me!

38:04.440 --> 38:05.600
It is the truth.

38:06.400 --> 38:07.840
- Dowry!
- Ouch!

38:07.920 --> 38:09.440
Do you think I will believe that?

38:09.960 --> 38:12.200
Speak your truth!
Where did you get the money?

38:12.280 --> 38:13.600
I have been investigating you
for a few days.

38:13.680 --> 38:17.160
The money you owed was all paid off
before your wife came to get you.

38:17.240 --> 38:19.520
How did you pay it off?
Is it the 1,000 guan from the Ji family?

38:19.600 --> 38:20.520
No!

38:20.600 --> 38:22.760
Sir, I am telling the truth.

38:22.840 --> 38:24.120
This is my money!

38:24.200 --> 38:25.320
Your money?

38:25.400 --> 38:26.800
Did you kill your wife

38:26.880 --> 38:28.360
and blame it on another
because of that 1,000 guan?

38:34.880 --> 38:36.200
Ji Yingying sent you, did she?

38:36.280 --> 38:37.840
Ji…!

38:37.920 --> 38:39.800
Who is that? I am asking you
where you got the money!

38:39.880 --> 38:41.120
Why are you bringing up someone else?

38:41.200 --> 38:42.320
Go back and tell Ji Yingying

38:42.400 --> 38:45.480
that even if you beat me to death today,
that person was murdered by her mother!

38:45.560 --> 38:48.640
The boatman and I saw it clearly!

38:48.720 --> 38:50.640
Do not try to push it on me! No deal!

38:50.720 --> 38:51.960
- I…
- Try it!

38:52.560 --> 38:53.640
Try and touch me again!

38:53.720 --> 38:56.960
I will report to the magistrate
that you are trying to kill a witness!

38:57.040 --> 38:58.240
Untie me!

38:58.320 --> 38:59.400
I say, untie me!

39:00.520 --> 39:03.240
I… Was I too straightforward?
Are we exposed?

39:06.080 --> 39:07.520
Since he dares to use the money
for gambling,

39:07.600 --> 39:09.920
that means he has thought of an excuse.

39:10.000 --> 39:11.320
I suppose we will not be able
to get him to confess.

39:12.160 --> 39:13.960
Then, have we wasted our efforts
these past few days?

39:14.640 --> 39:16.880
At least we know
that Uncle Feng is suspicious.

39:17.400 --> 39:19.080
Let us go and meet that boatman today.

39:20.200 --> 39:21.520
Hold on! Even if there is evidence,

39:21.600 --> 39:23.160
there is no use
if the magistrate will not go to court.

39:28.640 --> 39:29.960
My mother is innocent!

39:30.040 --> 39:33.480
Governor, please look into this
and get us justice!

39:33.560 --> 39:34.400
THE RESIDENCE OF YIZHOU'S GOVERNOR

39:38.800 --> 39:40.000
The governor said

39:40.080 --> 39:41.960
the local county magistrate
will handle the case.

39:42.040 --> 39:44.000
You are not to bypass
the chain of command!

39:44.520 --> 39:46.160
Mr. Meng is delaying the case
and refusing to go to court.

39:46.240 --> 39:48.120
My mother fell sick in custody,
but he forbids medical care!

39:48.200 --> 39:49.920
Governor, please get us justice!

39:50.000 --> 39:52.280
Governor, please have a look at my appeal!

39:52.360 --> 39:54.040
Off with the appeal!

39:54.120 --> 39:55.760
The governor
is being very generous to you.

39:55.840 --> 39:57.320
Do not be ungrateful!

39:57.400 --> 39:59.040
Leave at once.

39:59.120 --> 40:01.360
Otherwise, we will use punishment on you.

40:31.040 --> 40:34.440
I am Ji Yaoting of Sandaoyan.

40:35.160 --> 40:37.440
My mother, Mrs. Ji, was framed for murder.

40:37.520 --> 40:39.360
The county magistrate is delaying the case
and refusing to go to court.

40:39.440 --> 40:41.760
My mother fell sick in custody,
but he will not allow for medical care!

40:41.840 --> 40:44.200
Governor, please get us justice!

40:45.160 --> 40:47.240
Ji Yaoting, you are a commoner
going against a minister.

40:47.320 --> 40:48.400
You cannot do this!

40:48.480 --> 40:50.880
Yu, stay out of this.

40:53.080 --> 40:54.520
Ji Yaoting!

40:54.600 --> 40:56.640
The county magistrate
forbids medical care!

40:56.720 --> 40:59.400
Please get us justice, Governor!

41:01.640 --> 41:02.800
Move! Stand back!

41:06.280 --> 41:09.760
This man has caused disorder
and created a scene.

41:09.840 --> 41:14.200
The governor has ordered
that he be punished as a lesson.

41:17.680 --> 41:18.880
They are going to punish him!

41:18.960 --> 41:21.720
A brocade weaver
cares about their hands above all else.

41:22.240 --> 41:24.200
You still have the chance to repent now.

41:24.800 --> 41:25.840
Ji Yaoting!

41:26.440 --> 41:28.000
Even if I lose my hands today,

41:28.800 --> 41:33.040
I will still help my mother
appeal for her innocence!

41:34.240 --> 41:36.600
Let us see how long
you can keep this up! Do it!

41:42.200 --> 41:45.800
Ji Yaoting, at this juncture,
just surrender if you have to.

41:52.040 --> 41:55.600
My mother is a lone widow.
She empathizes with the poor and weak.

41:56.120 --> 41:57.760
She is virtuous,
yet she is being slandered.

41:58.280 --> 42:00.400
Where is the justice in this?

42:07.800 --> 42:08.880
Do you concede?

42:10.240 --> 42:13.200
My mother is sick!
She is denied medical care!

42:13.280 --> 42:15.440
A woman wronged and suffering unjustly!

42:15.520 --> 42:16.640
There is no regard for human life!

42:16.720 --> 42:18.400
What happened to justice?

42:18.480 --> 42:21.680
What happened to it?

42:22.360 --> 42:24.480
How dare you call yourself a minister
who serves the people?

42:24.560 --> 42:27.080
You are oppressing
a commoner out in public!

42:27.160 --> 42:29.160
You disregard the misfortune
we are suffering from!

42:29.240 --> 42:30.600
It is the Ji family today.

42:30.680 --> 42:32.840
Who knows which family
will suffer tomorrow?

42:34.000 --> 42:36.200
The Ji family's eldest son
came to appeal his mother's innocence.

42:36.280 --> 42:38.640
It is reasonable and legal,
yet he got punished for it.

42:38.720 --> 42:40.640
If we are wrongly accused in the future,

42:40.720 --> 42:43.000
does that mean we will be following
the footsteps of the Ji family

42:43.080 --> 42:45.160
and have no place
where we can appeal our innocence?

42:45.240 --> 42:47.080
- I agree!
- That's right.
